From: Zhiyi Zhang <zzhang@codeweavers.com>
Subject: Backport Wine MR 6911 wait-completion packets to Wine 10.20

Original series: https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/6911
Original patch SHA256: b8bff14e5ecadfb706b24c10bdfab89ee9ab893f0b72d32566e817a2dfd7e751
Local adaptations: append requests to preserve stock win32u client request IDs;
reject target objects without a wait callback instead of crashing wineserver.
Regenerate tools/make_requests and tools/make_specfiles before building.
The original closed draft is experimental, not an upstream released feature.

